  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gas Pipeline Network, through Advisian Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study, including a preliminary front-end engineering design, to support the development of Senegals first major domestic onshore gas pipeline (Project). The Project is expected to be the backbone of Senegals domestic gas sector, enabling the development of a mid- and downstream gas sector in Senegal and significantly reducing the cost of power generation. The Project will support the U.S. Governments Electrify Africa Act and Power and Prosper Africa Initiatives, as well as USTDAs U.S. Gas Infrastructure Exports Initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
